Hoshi Pilot"}},"relationType":"ALTERNATIVE","resolved":true}],"schemaVersion":"1.1.0","score":{"scale":100,"source":"anilist","value":65},"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":1984,"series":["al-1207"],"seriesIds":[1207],"startDate":{"day":11,"month":2,"year":1984},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":68,"name":"Mushi Production"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"After two-month-old kitten Chibi-neko is abandoned by her former owners, she is found by 18-year-old Tokio. Although his mother is allergic to cats and has a great fear of them, she agrees to let him keep the kitten because she fears he is becoming too withdrawn after failing his university entrance exams. Chibi-neko soon falls in love with Tokio.\n\nIn her own mind, Chibi-neko is a small human who speaks in human words, although people only ever seem to hear her meow, and she believes that all humans were once kittens like her. A stray cat tells Chibi-neko of a paradise called Cottonland, where dreams can come true.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)"},"tags":[{"name":"Nekomimi","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":25,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Homeless","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Star of Cottonland","english":"The Star of Cottonland","native":"綿の国星","romaji":"Wata no Kuni Hoshi","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"棉花国之星"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"绵之国星"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}